{
  "formatVersion": "2.0",
  "notes": [
    "One composition per imported procedure. A composition names the exact module versions the procedure is assembled from — never a module code resolved to 'latest'.",
    "'selectionBehavior': 'required' modules are always included and cannot be removed in the builder; 'default_on' modules start selected and may be removed; 'optional' modules start unselected.",
    "'compositionActions' are the only channel by which a procedure changes a requirement it inherits. Every action carries a reason, and the build script fails if an action matches nothing.",
    "'sequence' on a module reference orders the modules and, with each requirement's own sequence, produces the card's setup order.",
    "build with: npm run ip-cards:compositions"
  ],
